                        "maximum": 1.0,
                        "description": "Confidence in the verdict (0.0 to 1.0). High confidence (>0.9): Clear determination, no ambiguity. Medium confidence (0.5-0.9): Some uncertainty or edge cases. Low confidence (<0.5): Highly ambiguous or incomplete information."
                    },
                    "issues": {
