                                    "description": "Clear explanation of the issue (up to 500 tokens). Include full mathematical reasoning that would have been in the detailed verification log. For CRITICAL_ERROR: Explain why reasoning is invalid or answer is wrong. For JUSTIFICATION_GAP: Explain what justification is missing."
                                },
                                "severity": {
